# Global summon keys. Read by bin/bro-hotkeys, registered by BroBar.
#
# Everything here is commented out, so the defaults below are what is live:
#
#   voice   option+section    ⌥§   open the mic now, from any app
#   text    control+section   ⌃§   a one-line field for a typed ask
#
# Both sit on §, the key left of 1 — one key, the modifier picks voice or text.
# Vox owns ⌘§ on this machine; bro deliberately does not touch it.
#
# Uncomment and edit to rebind. Modifiers: cmd, opt/option/alt, ctrl, shift.
# Keys: section, a-z, 0-9, f1-f19, space, escape, tab, return, arrows, and
# punctuation by name (grave, minus, comma, period, slash, ...).
# `off` disables a summon entirely. A binding with no modifier is refused —
# it would swallow that key system-wide.
#
# voice option+section
# text control+section

